### Create PaymentIntent for an order
POST http://localhost:3000/api/payments/create-intent
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ADMIN_TOKEN
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": "YOUR_ORDER_ID_HERE"
}




